<h2>Segment 215 &mdash; where mental seeds are planted</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s215S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w1"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m1">gnyis</span> pa</span> ni, <span class="u conditional" data-d="6" data-l="s215p1">gal te</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w2"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m2">kun gzhi</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m3">rnam shes</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w3">khas mi len</span> <span class="u concessive" data-d="6" data-l="s215p2">kyang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w4">dge</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w5"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m4">mi</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m5">dge</span></span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w6">bag chags</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w7">&#x27;jog pa</span> <span class="u coordination" data-d="6" data-l="s215p3">dang</span> , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w8">bag chags</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w9">de</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w10">smin pa</span> <span class="u case" data-d="6" data-l="s215p4">las</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w11">&#x27;bras bu</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w12">&#x27;byung bar</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w13">&#x27;dod</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w14">dgos</span> te, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w15"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m6">&#x27;jug</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m7">&#x27;grel</span></span> las, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w16"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m8">thog ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m9">med pa</span></span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w17">&#x27;khor bar</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w18">dngos po</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w19">bag chags</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w20">bzhag pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w21">yongs su smin pa</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w22">dngos po</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w23">mngon par zhen pa</span>, zhes dang , <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s215w24">de &#x27;dra ba</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w25">gzhan</span> <span class="u additive" data-d="6" data-l="s215p5">yang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w26">mang du</span> &#x27;byung ba&#x27;i phyir ro, , de <span class="u continuative" data-d="6" data-l="s215p6">yang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w28">bag chags</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w29">&#x27;jog pa</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w30">gzhi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w31">med</span> par <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w32">mi rung</span> bas <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w33">gzhi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w34">de</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w35">gang</span> yin zhe na</span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s215S">Here is the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w1"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m1">second</span> part</span> [of a different] discussion [about where the Madhyamika school believes the mental seeds from karma are planted, since they do not accept the concept of foundation consciousness]. One may begin with the following question: <span class="u conditional" data-d="6" data-l="s215p1">Suppose</span> you <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w3">deny</span> then the existence of a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w2"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m2">foundation</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m3">consciousness</span></span>. <span class="u concessive" data-d="6" data-l="s215p2">Nonetheless</span> you <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w14">must</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w13">accept</span> that <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w6">mental seeds</span> from <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w4">virtue</span> or <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w5"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m4">non</span>-<span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m5">virtue</span></span> do get <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w7">planted</span>, <span class="u coordination" data-d="6" data-l="s215p3">and</span> that <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w11">consequences</span> do <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w12">arise</span> <span class="u case" data-d="6" data-l="s215p4">from</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w10">ripening</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w9">these</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w8">mental seeds</span>. After all, the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w15"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m7">autocommentary</span> to <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m6">Entering</span> the Middle Way</span> does state that &quot;For <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w16">time <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m9">without</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s215m8">beginning</span></span>, in the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w17">suffering cycle of life</span>, the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w19">mental seeds</span> for <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w18">things</span> have been <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w20">planted</span>, and have then <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w21">ripened</span>, and have then been <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w23">interpreted</span> by people as the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w22">things</span> themselves.&quot; There are <span class="u additive" data-d="6" data-l="s215p5">as well</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w26">many</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w25">other</span> quotations which mention the <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s215w24">same thing</span>. <span class="u continuative" data-d="6" data-l="s215p6">And</span> it would be <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w32">incorrect</span> to say that there existed <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w31">no</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w30">basis</span> or place where these <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w28">mental seeds</span> were <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w29">planted</span>. <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w35">What</span> then, according to your view, provides <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w34">this</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s215w33">place</span> for the seeds to be planted?</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; <p>PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, reconciled from two independent proposals. Binding HGM fields attest gnyis pa/second part and khas mi len/deny as lexical units: the former keeps the contained gnyis/second member, and the latter is a complete negative verb, with no invented negation null. mi dge/non-virtue retains mi/non and dge/virtue inside the hyphenated compound; non is bounded by a hyphen, not an added subword exception. The established autocommentary title and beginningless-time compound retain unique tighter members. 'khor bar/suffering cycle of life is the source's contextual rendering of cyclic life; the glossary for the inflected form contains in the circle of suffering life, not this exact English string. yongs su smin pa/ripened is directly HGM-attested.</p><p>Suppose advances beyond the bracketed editorial explanation: foundation consciousness and all four mental seeds select the translated argument, not bracketed repeats. de 'dra ba/same thing is a complete anaphoric similarity phrase at d3; neither the supplied quotations noun nor mention is assigned to a false atom. The later de in de yang does not own the dummy it in it would be incorrect to say: that it has no anaphoric referent. The continuative yang supplies And. The first final gzhi is banked once as basis, leaving its synonymous restatement or place unwrapped; the second owns place in What ... this place. Final yin zhe na, repeated seeds/planted, and distributed quotation/question framing are omitted rather than falsely nulled. Articles, you, passive auxiliaries and by people/themselves remain unwrapped. Exact C16 text and shorter or differently translated ILL parallels establish no correction or publication independence; no erratum is proposed.</p></div>
